  "an3.40:7.1": "The Ender: an epithet for Māra, who as repeated mortality keeps putting an end to things.",
  "an3.40:7.2": "",
  "an3.40:7.3": "Such <i>(tādin):</i> An adjective applied to the mind of one who has attained the goal. It indicates that the mind “is what it is”—indescribable but not subject to change or alteration.",
